flowchart LR
    IaC[Terraform and IaC input] --> Parser[Plan parser]
    Parser --> Detector[Deterministic detector]
    Detector --> Adapter[Sandbox adapter registry]
    Adapter --> Azure[LocalStack Azure]
    Adapter --> AWS[LocalStack AWS]
    Adapter --> K8s[kind Kubernetes]
    Adapter --> Compose[Docker Compose digital twin]
    Adapter --> OnPrem[MicroVM / on-prem digital twin]
    Adapter --> Plan[Plan-only mode]
    Detector --> Red[Red-team agent instructions]
    Red --> Evidence[Exploit evidence]
    Evidence --> Blue[Blue-team remediation instructions]
    Blue --> Patch[Patch validator]
    Patch --> Report[Report and metrics artifacts]
